<title>USA: Gaylord Entertainment to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Gaylord Entertainment to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaylord Entertainment Co said Tuesday it plans to buy back $100 million of its outstanding Class A common stock over the next three years.</p>
<p>It plans to make the purchases on the open market as well as in private transactions.</p>
<p>The amount and timing of the transactions will depend on the market and other conditions. The prices will vary as authorized by company management, it said.</p>
</text>
